targetsboard bundles JavaScript libraries written by others. Their sources
are on npm, at the versions below; the board's own JavaScript sources, and
the files that build the bundles from them (package.json, package-lock.json,
webpack.config.js), are in the package's repository:
https://github.com/Athospd/targetsboard (folder srcjs/).

inst/htmlwidgets/targetsboard.js, the board's widget, bundles:

  react 18.3.1, react-dom 18.3.1, scheduler 0.23.2,
  use-sync-external-store 1.2.2
